@API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5050

### 1. Lấy danh sách cửa hàng
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/stores
Accept: application/json

### 2. Kích hoạt trạm Kiosk với mã OTP
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/kiosk/activate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "POS-1234"
}

### 3. Xác thực PIN Kiosk 2 bước
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/kiosk/attendance/validate-pin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "storeId": 1,
  "employeeCode": "CSH001",
  "pinCode": "1234"
}

### 4. Lấy danh sách ca làm việc Kiosk hôm nay
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/kiosk/attendance/roster?storeId=1
Accept: application/json
